// 003.7, 005.4 (D32): reading a `Function` at an unassigned argument in an effect halts with
// missing input (CHR100), even when the function has values at other keys.
//! expect-error: CHR100
Fact shop Identified by Calloway
Fact item Identified by Apple, Banana
Fact usd Identified by Money(USD, 2)
Function price Identified by item * usd
Fact charged Identified by item * usd
Act sell Actor shop Related to item Holds when True
  Creates charged(item, price.usd) When price.item == item
.
+price(Apple, 100).
sell(Calloway, Apple).
?charged(Apple, 100).
sell(Calloway, Banana).
